                                                "sense_id": "9520a600-6254-35fd-aa30-1296dba82c5f",
                                                "text": "[…] rain, too, had lately fallen, and had decidedly not evaporated, since, at every step, I went squash! squash! up to the tops of my boots, and many times very extent, stretching to the eastward, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "979c1169-6d6b-41ff-8abc-5a2e8099f737",
                                                "sense_id": "9520a600-6254-35fd-aa30-1296dba82c5f",
                                                "text": "[…] to catch all the rain […]; my boots went squash, squash, as I turned on to the high road, […]"
                                            },
